WEBVTT

00:00.967 --> 00:02.507
♪

00:02.597 --> 00:03.967
[RAY] Let's hear your numbers.

00:04.057 --> 00:05.467
One!

00:06.347 --> 00:07.227
Uh.

00:08.267 --> 00:10.647
-[RAY] Private Ariane?
-Hmm.

00:10.727 --> 00:13.267
-Hey, Private Ariane.
-Yes?

00:13.357 --> 00:15.607
It's early, but you can't
let your guard down.

00:15.687 --> 00:17.737
Doing so could result in
immediate death.

00:18.317 --> 00:19.317
[Ariane whimpers]

00:19.397 --> 00:20.857
Again, numbers.

00:20.947 --> 00:23.367
-[STELLA] One!
-[ARIANE] Two!

00:23.697 --> 00:24.737
Great.

00:24.827 --> 00:26.537
It's time to start
today's training.

00:27.787 --> 00:30.247
[ARIANE] I don't know, maybe
it's because it's so early,

00:30.917 --> 00:32.417
but Black, I, I mean

00:32.497 --> 00:35.457
Ray looks even more dashing
than usual.

00:35.537 --> 00:38.547
Hey, Ariane, do you have a fever
or something?

00:38.627 --> 00:40.127
-Are you okay?
-[chuckles nervously]

00:40.217 --> 00:43.137
No fever.
There's nothing wrong with me.

00:43.217 --> 00:44.347
You see this?

00:44.427 --> 00:46.177
I'm fine, just like always.

00:46.267 --> 00:48.677
[echoes] Like always,
like always, like always.

00:48.767 --> 00:50.057
[DINA] Ah, so that's it.

00:50.807 --> 00:52.307
Everything's crystal clear now.

00:53.347 --> 00:56.317
Dang, Maria. This is a big
treasure trove of info.

00:57.277 --> 00:58.647
Do you hear me?

00:58.737 --> 01:00.147
Hey, Maria.

01:00.237 --> 01:01.447
[gasps]

01:01.527 --> 01:04.157
-What? I'm awake.
-Report to her posthaste.

01:05.027 --> 01:07.157
♪

01:11.537 --> 01:12.417
[REBECCA] Ha!

01:13.117 --> 01:14.917
♪

01:16.627 --> 01:18.167
Just as I suspected.

01:18.257 --> 01:20.667
If I want to compete,
I'll need to hurry.

01:25.337 --> 01:26.427
Bye.

01:29.557 --> 01:32.637
-Uh, Mother? I was just--
-What is it, dear?

01:33.267 --> 01:34.977
Are you going somewhere?

01:35.057 --> 01:36.437
Oh, of course not.

01:36.517 --> 01:38.397
Why would I want to go anywhere
that isn't right here

01:38.477 --> 01:39.937
in the comfort of my own home?

01:40.027 --> 01:42.317
The meeting is about to start,
you know?

01:42.397 --> 01:43.737
And what are you wearing?

01:43.817 --> 01:45.407
It's outrageous.

01:45.487 --> 01:47.657
Hurry up and change
before you leave.

01:47.737 --> 01:50.117
Oh, please just kill me.

01:50.197 --> 01:51.157
[groans]

01:51.827 --> 01:53.617
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:39.377 --> 02:41.297
[LYDIA]
By the way, where did Abbie go?

02:41.377 --> 02:43.297
[CAROL] Well, Abbie
is the chairwoman of operations,

02:43.377 --> 02:45.797
so during the tournament
she's super busy.

02:45.877 --> 02:47.177
[LIESELOTTE] I don't envy her.

02:47.257 --> 02:48.297
As for us,

02:48.387 --> 02:49.757
where do we go?

02:49.847 --> 02:51.257
[LYDIA]
Any place where there's space.

03:03.437 --> 03:04.647
[panting]

03:10.827 --> 03:12.367
[continues panting]

03:13.287 --> 03:15.707
-[Stella grunts]
-[Ariane screams]

03:19.247 --> 03:20.917
-[Ariane screams]
-Sorry, Ariane!

03:20.997 --> 03:22.207
Are you okay?

03:22.287 --> 03:25.757
Okay? Kay? Ay?

03:25.837 --> 03:26.757
[groans]

03:28.007 --> 03:29.967
Yes, for the most part.

03:30.047 --> 03:32.007
[RAY] Private Ariane!

03:32.097 --> 03:33.927
The Magicks War
is guerrilla warfare

03:34.007 --> 03:35.477
with multiple combatants.

03:35.557 --> 03:37.227
Always keep your head
on a swivel.

03:37.307 --> 03:40.017
Don't focus too much
on what's in front of you.

03:41.267 --> 03:43.857
If you can't do that,
then be prepared to die.

03:43.937 --> 03:46.607
-Roger.
-Let's go again.

03:46.697 --> 03:48.107
Roger.

03:49.237 --> 03:50.527
What's wrong?

03:50.607 --> 03:53.117
Oh, uh, I...

03:53.197 --> 03:56.617
-Huh? Ariane?
-I, um...

03:56.697 --> 03:58.617
Well, I, I just...

03:59.457 --> 04:01.247
-Are you sick?
-No!

04:01.827 --> 04:03.457
I'm fine, I swear.

04:03.537 --> 04:05.507
-No, really, I am.
-Good.

04:05.587 --> 04:07.297
-Then, let's go.
-Roger!

04:09.717 --> 04:11.047
What is this?

04:11.337 --> 04:14.507
Why is my heart constantly
trying to leap out of my chest?

04:17.557 --> 04:19.017
[both panting]

04:20.977 --> 04:22.517
[LUCAS] So, shall we continue?

04:22.607 --> 04:24.147
Huh?

04:24.227 --> 04:26.147
[both yelling]

04:29.397 --> 04:30.907
[both groan]

04:38.287 --> 04:40.157
Go on, Ariane.

04:40.247 --> 04:41.667
What's your next move?

04:42.417 --> 04:43.827
-[leaves rustling]
-[gasps]

04:43.917 --> 04:45.547
I've got you now!

04:47.417 --> 04:49.047
[panting]

04:49.127 --> 04:52.177
Boo. That was almost cool.

04:52.257 --> 04:53.427
-[RAY] Stella.
-Huh?

04:53.507 --> 04:55.257
Don't speak before you attack.

04:55.347 --> 04:57.097
You'll lose
the element of surprise.

04:57.177 --> 04:58.557
Oh, that's a good point.

04:58.637 --> 05:01.517
[chuckles] I got lost
in the moment is all.

05:01.597 --> 05:04.357
-Next time, my lips are sealed.
-Good.

05:04.437 --> 05:05.607
Let's go.

05:05.687 --> 05:07.857
That's my little sister for you.

05:07.937 --> 05:10.277
It's hard to resist
giving her a pat on the head.

05:10.357 --> 05:12.317
She's just too adorable.

05:13.067 --> 05:14.697
♪

05:14.777 --> 05:17.827
-[ARIANE] Uh, Ray?
-Yeah, what's up?

05:17.907 --> 05:18.867
I must admit

05:19.367 --> 05:21.497
that being carried like this
is very embarrassing.

05:21.577 --> 05:23.827
Sorry, we've got no choice.

05:23.917 --> 05:25.707
I suppose you're right.

05:25.787 --> 05:27.627
You did really good today.

05:27.707 --> 05:30.257
There was a moment
I genuinely thought I might die.

05:30.337 --> 05:32.467
The fact that you evaded us
for over an hour

05:32.547 --> 05:34.297
was, like, totally awesome.

05:34.387 --> 05:36.257
[RAY] Yeah, I was impressed.

05:36.347 --> 05:37.387
[sighs]

05:37.757 --> 05:40.217
Well, my reputation as a maiden
was riding on it.

05:41.177 --> 05:43.437
-May I ask?
-[RAY] Yeah, go for it.

05:44.137 --> 05:46.607
Do you think I'm actually
getting any stronger?

05:47.107 --> 05:48.017
I know you are.

05:48.107 --> 05:49.277
In two days,

05:49.357 --> 05:51.487
you figured out how to dodge
the both of us.

05:51.567 --> 05:53.737
You're definitely
getting stronger, Ariane.

05:53.817 --> 05:56.277
[sighs]
That means a lot from you.

05:58.527 --> 06:00.077
[Stella snoring]

06:00.157 --> 06:02.247
Come and get me, then.

06:07.917 --> 06:08.797
Huh?

06:09.627 --> 06:10.667
Ray.

06:11.627 --> 06:12.717
You'll freeze.

06:13.167 --> 06:15.087
It is chilly, thank you.

06:16.837 --> 06:18.257
Well, this is awkward.

06:18.347 --> 06:19.257
[RAY] Hmm?

06:19.757 --> 06:20.847
[ARIANE] I guess I wasn't able

06:20.927 --> 06:22.767
to keep my head
on a swivel, huh?

06:22.847 --> 06:24.137
[RAY] Is there
something else on your mind?

06:25.057 --> 06:27.267
[ARIANE] I never talked to you
about it, did I?

06:27.357 --> 06:29.397
The reason I asked you
to do this.

06:29.477 --> 06:30.647
[RAY] Huh?

06:30.727 --> 06:33.147
I want to try my hand
in battle together

06:33.237 --> 06:34.987
with both you and Amelia.

06:35.067 --> 06:36.907
But more importantly...

06:37.407 --> 06:39.907
My goal is to change myself
for the better.

06:41.327 --> 06:44.407
As a noble,
I never knew how to behave,

06:44.497 --> 06:47.457
so I've always just done my best
to copy Amelia.

06:47.537 --> 06:49.287
Never show any hint of weakness.

06:49.377 --> 06:50.917
Try and keep my head down.

06:50.997 --> 06:53.757
For her, I'd be stronger.

06:53.837 --> 06:55.797
I thought
I was doing it for her.

06:55.877 --> 06:58.427
That it was my duty
because we were best friends.

06:58.927 --> 07:00.927
[grins] I was naive.

07:01.427 --> 07:04.017
The truth is she was
much more talented than me

07:04.097 --> 07:06.977
and I could barely stomach
watching her succeed.

07:07.057 --> 07:09.857
She forced me
to see that I was miserable,

07:09.937 --> 07:11.687
drowning in my own pride.

07:12.397 --> 07:14.897
I felt so pathetic
compared to her,

07:14.987 --> 07:18.237
and my jealousy
only validated those feelings.

07:18.317 --> 07:20.237
She grew bitter after we fought.

07:20.317 --> 07:22.197
She spiraled until
someone saved her.

07:23.037 --> 07:24.497
Ray, it was you.

07:25.657 --> 07:27.497
I thought if I trained with you,

07:27.577 --> 07:30.247
maybe I could stop spiraling
and save myself.

07:31.497 --> 07:33.837
I know it's selfish.
You don't have to say it.

07:35.377 --> 07:37.177
-Ariane.
-[gasps]

07:37.257 --> 07:39.587
Don't talk. Just listen.

07:39.677 --> 07:41.637
We can all become envious.

07:41.717 --> 07:43.467
It's nothing to be ashamed of.

07:44.387 --> 07:46.727
I'm jealous when people have
a peaceful life.

07:46.807 --> 07:47.977
It's true.

07:48.267 --> 07:50.607
Sometimes I can't stand myself
for feeling that way.

07:52.437 --> 07:55.647
When we're spiraling,
it's okay to ask for help.

07:55.937 --> 07:56.857
[gasps]

07:57.777 --> 07:59.147
I'm allowed to do that?

08:01.527 --> 08:02.567
[sobs]

08:03.277 --> 08:04.157
Yes.

08:05.077 --> 08:08.707
Thank you
for helping save me, too.

08:12.377 --> 08:14.627
Ariane,
we've got an early morning.

08:15.507 --> 08:16.377
Shall we go?

08:18.047 --> 08:19.257
-Yes.
-Great.

08:19.337 --> 08:21.007
-Come on.
-Huh? [gasps]

08:22.137 --> 08:23.177
What's wrong?

08:23.717 --> 08:28.057
Nothing, but can you
keep holding my hand?

08:28.137 --> 08:29.807
Just till we're back.

08:29.887 --> 08:31.807
[grins] Yeah, of course.

08:31.897 --> 08:34.517
-Tomorrow will be great.
-[chuckles]

08:35.267 --> 08:36.567
[ARIANE] Yeah!

08:36.647 --> 08:37.857
-[string snaps]
-[Rebecca whimpers]

08:37.937 --> 08:40.277
-Oh.
-[WOMEN] Bun-bun-bunny!

08:41.237 --> 08:43.027
Well, that was weird.

08:43.117 --> 08:45.197
[groaning]

08:45.277 --> 08:46.907
Uh. [grunts]

08:50.457 --> 08:51.957
-[LIESELOTTE] Amelia?
-[gasps]

08:52.747 --> 08:55.037
[AMELIA]
I hope I didn't disturb you.

08:55.127 --> 08:56.417
Are you feeling all right?

08:56.497 --> 08:59.257
Oh, yeah. I'm totally fine.

08:59.337 --> 09:01.337
-Got your nose in a book?
-Yes.

09:01.427 --> 09:03.927
You're reading her too,
aren't you? Luna Ether?

09:04.797 --> 09:05.757
Yes.

09:05.847 --> 09:07.427
I take it you enjoy her work.

09:07.507 --> 09:10.427
Uh, yeah.
Ray introduced me to her,

09:10.517 --> 09:12.557
then I couldn't
put her books down.

09:12.637 --> 09:14.937
Wow, what an honor
to meet a fan.

09:15.017 --> 09:16.107
What?

09:16.187 --> 09:17.647
It's not often
that I get the chance

09:17.727 --> 09:19.357
to meet my readers in person.

09:19.437 --> 09:20.737
[gasps]

09:20.817 --> 09:22.447
-Here.
-Uh.

09:24.777 --> 09:27.117
My newest one.
Hasn't hit the market yet.

09:27.197 --> 09:28.117
[AMELIA] Really?

09:28.197 --> 09:30.577
-You can have it.
-[gasps]

09:30.657 --> 09:34.627
The secretive romance novelist
shrouded in mystery?

09:34.707 --> 09:35.627
It's me.

09:36.287 --> 09:37.587
I'm Luna Ether.

09:37.667 --> 09:38.587
What?

09:38.667 --> 09:41.087
[Amelia screams] What?

09:43.467 --> 09:45.847
[groaning]

09:46.427 --> 09:47.887
I refuse to lose.

09:47.967 --> 09:49.807
I'll hit you once, just watch!

09:56.767 --> 09:58.817
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

10:01.647 --> 10:03.107
[groans]

10:05.527 --> 10:07.487
[EVI] Al, you all right?

10:09.237 --> 10:11.537
Yeah. Never been better.

10:11.617 --> 10:13.247
-[LUCAS] Hey, Albert.
-Huh?

10:15.127 --> 10:16.287
You got a sec?

10:17.127 --> 10:20.507
[footsteps]

10:20.587 --> 10:23.007
Let's go.

10:23.797 --> 10:26.177
What's this?
You're too slow, Private.

10:26.257 --> 10:27.257
Huh?

10:33.137 --> 10:34.517
[chuckles]

10:34.597 --> 10:36.437
Not bad, Private Ariane.

10:39.647 --> 10:40.817
I'll write that down.

10:48.027 --> 10:49.577
Yes, that's it.

10:49.657 --> 10:52.367
[yelling]

10:59.247 --> 11:00.127
Hmm?

11:09.217 --> 11:11.097
[RAY] In these last two weeks
of training,

11:11.177 --> 11:13.467
I can tell how hard
you've pushed yourselves.

11:13.557 --> 11:14.767
[ARIANE, STELLA] Roger!

11:14.847 --> 11:17.097
[RAY] We will now begin
our final exercise!

11:17.187 --> 11:18.607
[ARIANE, STELLA] Roger!

11:18.687 --> 11:19.767
Private Ariane,

11:20.057 --> 11:22.397
you and Sister White Gray
will train as a team.

11:22.477 --> 11:25.897
-[STELLA] Roger!
-The ban on magic is lifted.

11:25.987 --> 11:28.407
In the very heart
of the Dogma Forest,

11:28.487 --> 11:30.697
I will be waiting for you
under the legendy tree.

11:30.777 --> 11:33.537
Once you're ready to put
your training to the test,

11:33.617 --> 11:35.197
come at me
with everything you've got

11:35.287 --> 11:36.957
and tear this rose
from my chest.

11:37.037 --> 11:37.917
[ARIANE, STELLA] Roger!

11:38.627 --> 11:40.667
I'm coming for that rose,
Master Black.

11:41.997 --> 11:42.957
[ARIANE] Ogre!

11:43.047 --> 11:45.127
-[lightning crackling]
-[grunts]

11:53.557 --> 11:55.807
Give me your best defense
right now.

11:55.887 --> 11:57.557
[groans]

12:04.857 --> 12:06.067
-[leaves rustling]
-Huh?

12:08.987 --> 12:09.987
[groans]

12:12.577 --> 12:13.447
Seriously?

12:14.277 --> 12:15.327
It's a decoy!

12:15.407 --> 12:17.457
[Stella yelling]

12:20.877 --> 12:22.707
-Stella?
-Now, Ariane!

12:22.787 --> 12:24.207
I've got him trapped.

12:24.287 --> 12:26.377
Get over here and finish this!

12:28.917 --> 12:31.507
[breathing heavily]

12:31.587 --> 12:34.047
[groans] You've gotta move now.

12:34.137 --> 12:35.757
I can't hold much longer.

12:35.847 --> 12:37.807
-[ARIANE] Roger!
-[both] Huh?

12:38.517 --> 12:41.767
Ogre Scintilla!

12:41.847 --> 12:42.857
[sighs]

12:52.817 --> 12:54.947
It's gone. Very impressive!

12:55.027 --> 12:57.287
[STELLA]
Ariane, you knocked it off!

12:57.367 --> 12:58.447
[RAY] After all your hard work

12:58.537 --> 13:00.037
in this Ainsworth-style
boot camp,

13:00.617 --> 13:03.207
you've completed the
"Chapter in Survival Training!"

13:04.587 --> 13:06.287
[chuckles softly]

13:06.377 --> 13:09.467
[ARIANE] Roger!

13:15.257 --> 13:17.557
Yes, your magic has improved.

13:17.637 --> 13:19.137
Your butterfly effect has grown.

13:19.227 --> 13:21.137
It's magnificent.

13:23.267 --> 13:24.607
[exhales sharply]

13:24.687 --> 13:27.317
I imagine you manifested this
out of necessity.

13:27.397 --> 13:30.147
-You are capable of great power.
-Huh?

13:30.237 --> 13:32.697
I think you've learned
all that you can from me.

13:32.777 --> 13:35.907
-Does that mean we're done?
-Yeah.

13:35.987 --> 13:38.537
I helped you build
a solid foundation.

13:38.617 --> 13:40.157
The rest of the work is up
to you.

13:40.247 --> 13:43.167
This also means I repaid Ray
for his favor.

13:43.247 --> 13:45.077
Oh, yeah.
I keep meaning to ask you

13:45.167 --> 13:46.127
about your relationship
with him.

13:46.207 --> 13:47.167
[LIESELOTTE]
Ray and I are lovers.

13:47.247 --> 13:48.417
[screams]

13:50.087 --> 13:51.507
[LIESELOTTE]
Just messing with you.

13:51.587 --> 13:53.797
I wouldn't worry about
our relationship if I were you.

13:53.887 --> 13:55.257
Uh, yeah.

13:55.347 --> 13:57.007
Could you not joke around
like that?

13:57.097 --> 13:58.887
I can hardly tell
when the seriousness ends

13:58.967 --> 14:00.267
and the jokes begin.

14:00.347 --> 14:03.597
Apologies. You know,
despite being an Ordinary,

14:03.687 --> 14:05.267
he's the youngest person
in history

14:05.357 --> 14:07.107
to become one of
the Seven Grands.

14:07.187 --> 14:09.937
I'd say your betrothal to him
would be well accepted.

14:10.027 --> 14:11.187
Bethro-what?

14:11.277 --> 14:12.817
I think it would be
a good match.

14:12.897 --> 14:14.357
[chuckles nervously]

14:14.447 --> 14:16.067
-Oh, the two of us?
-Yeah.

14:16.157 --> 14:17.157
You think so? [laughs]

14:17.237 --> 14:18.777
I hope both of your stars align.

14:18.867 --> 14:19.947
Oh, you.

14:20.037 --> 14:21.997
[continues chuckling]

14:22.657 --> 14:24.327
May fortune smile upon you.

14:25.627 --> 14:27.207
[ARIANE]
I know I wasn't here long,

14:27.287 --> 14:28.997
but you've done so much for me.

14:29.087 --> 14:30.587
Oh, we were happy to help.

14:30.667 --> 14:32.467
Yes, we're going to miss you.

14:32.547 --> 14:33.547
And Ariane?

14:33.627 --> 14:35.047
-[RAY] Hmm?
-Yes?

14:35.127 --> 14:36.637
-Make your move.
-[gasps]

14:36.717 --> 14:37.967
Uh, I...

14:38.047 --> 14:39.097
Right!

14:39.177 --> 14:40.847
-Yes, ma'am.
-Mm-hmm.

14:42.137 --> 14:45.517
Big brother, I promise I'll be
in the stands cheering you on.

14:45.597 --> 14:47.727
And I'm counting on you
to help him win this thing.

14:47.807 --> 14:49.357
Great. Thanks, sis.

14:49.437 --> 14:50.727
Yeah, I will.

14:52.687 --> 14:53.607
Shall we?

14:55.237 --> 14:56.857
Sure, let's go.

15:00.197 --> 15:02.617
You know,
we should get going, too.

15:02.697 --> 15:04.497
You mean I can finally go home?

15:04.577 --> 15:06.537
-What are you guys up to?
-[screams]

15:06.617 --> 15:09.457
[STELLA] I'll take it you're not
from around here, are you?

15:09.537 --> 15:12.507
-Well, we...
-I, uh...

15:12.587 --> 15:14.377
-[DINA] This is...
-[MARIA] We just...

15:14.467 --> 15:15.917
-What is that?
-[MARIA] What?

15:16.007 --> 15:17.837
[STELLA]
Does it make your ears hurt?

15:17.927 --> 15:19.637
[MARIA] Oh! No?

15:19.717 --> 15:21.927
-They look so cool.
-Huh?

15:22.007 --> 15:24.097
Oh, thank you, I think.

15:24.177 --> 15:25.637
-[Dina chuckles]
-[STELLA] Huh?

15:25.727 --> 15:27.977
Sorry, but we must return
to our lands.

15:28.057 --> 15:29.477
-[STELLA] Huh?
-Sayonara!

15:29.557 --> 15:30.557
[MARIA] What?

15:30.647 --> 15:32.267
[Maria screams]

15:32.357 --> 15:34.317
Sayonara?

15:34.397 --> 15:36.277
[birds chirping]

15:42.117 --> 15:43.027
Here's to us.

15:43.117 --> 15:44.787
Roger!

15:50.707 --> 15:51.917
[Amelia gasps]

15:51.997 --> 15:54.457
[groaning]

15:54.547 --> 15:55.917
Ariane?

15:57.627 --> 15:58.967
[CLARIS]
Look, it's finally time.

15:59.047 --> 16:00.337
Oh, man, this feels like

16:00.427 --> 16:02.757
the beginning
of the tournament, right Elisa?

16:02.847 --> 16:04.887
-Mm-hmm.
-Is something wrong?

16:05.597 --> 16:06.727
Um...

16:06.807 --> 16:08.977
Well, I just...

16:10.477 --> 16:13.477
-[fireworks exploding]
-[crowd cheering]

16:13.567 --> 16:15.937
[DINA ON PA] Welcome
to the first ever Magicks War.

16:16.027 --> 16:16.987
We're just in the prelims,

16:17.567 --> 16:20.447
but the stadium is packed
and the tension is palpable.

16:20.527 --> 16:23.777
-Guys, I'm kind of freaking out.
-Oh, come on.

16:23.867 --> 16:25.867
Why do you have
to get yourself so worked up?

16:25.947 --> 16:27.617
All right, are you ready, girls?

16:27.707 --> 16:29.367
-Aye-aye!
-And now!

16:29.457 --> 16:32.997
[TOGETHER]
Give 'em hell, Amelia! Let's go!

16:33.087 --> 16:34.997
All right, this is it, Elisa.

16:35.087 --> 16:36.047
Yeah!

16:36.337 --> 16:37.797
I'm rooting for Ray
and his team, but...

16:37.877 --> 16:40.177
-Also for Albert and Evi.
-That's it.

16:40.257 --> 16:43.097
[STELLA]
Wow, this place is huge.

16:43.177 --> 16:45.217
And the stadium is amazing.

16:45.307 --> 16:48.177
I know! And I can't believe
how many people are here.

16:48.267 --> 16:50.637
Yeah. I knew it would be packed,
but whoa.

16:50.727 --> 16:52.937
I'm gonna go see
if I can find Lydia.

16:53.017 --> 16:54.107
[SASHA] Stella, hang on!

16:54.187 --> 16:55.227
[Francoise humming]

16:55.517 --> 16:56.687
[SASHA] What are we gonna
do with that girl?

16:56.777 --> 16:58.397
[LUTHER]
Well, she has her ticket,

16:58.487 --> 17:00.067
so we'll just wait by our seats.

17:00.147 --> 17:01.317
[SASHA] Right.

17:01.397 --> 17:04.487
Now, where could Liese
and the others be?

17:04.577 --> 17:06.947
-Are you here all by yourself?
-Huh?

17:07.037 --> 17:09.907
Did your mommy and daddy
not come with you today?

17:09.997 --> 17:12.247
Can we help you look for them?

17:12.327 --> 17:14.457
[FRANCOISE]
There's no need to fret.

17:14.537 --> 17:16.957
It's kind of you
to be concerned.

17:17.047 --> 17:19.377
So conscientious for someone
as young as yourself.

17:20.007 --> 17:23.007
[singing]
♪ There is only one! ♪

17:23.087 --> 17:24.427
[DINA ON PA] Joining us
for today's tournament

17:24.507 --> 17:27.007
are representatives from
all three great noble houses,

17:27.097 --> 17:29.387
along with many other
distinguished guests.

17:29.467 --> 17:30.927
And most exciting of all,

17:31.017 --> 17:32.887
we're honored
to welcome Olivia Arnold,

17:32.977 --> 17:33.937
the second crown princess

17:34.437 --> 17:35.857
-of the royal Arnold Family.
-It's about to start.

17:35.937 --> 17:38.477
Where on earth did Rebecca
and Maria get off to?

17:38.567 --> 17:40.147
[DINA ON PA]...round of
applause worthy of royalty.

17:40.237 --> 17:41.397
[crowd cheering]

17:41.487 --> 17:42.567
[GUARD 1] She's not here.

17:42.647 --> 17:44.697
-Princess Olivia disappeared.
-What?

17:44.777 --> 17:46.117
-She's gone?
-No.

17:46.197 --> 17:48.537
We need to find her
or else we're all dead.

17:49.197 --> 17:50.787
[chuckles] Oh, please.

17:50.867 --> 17:52.327
I can't properly cheer
for my Ray

17:52.407 --> 17:54.537
if I stay in that stuffy place.

17:54.627 --> 17:55.747
-[Stella grunts]
-Huh?

17:55.837 --> 17:57.297
[thuds]

17:57.377 --> 17:58.627
[groans]

17:58.707 --> 18:00.837
-Are you okay?
-Uh.

18:01.587 --> 18:03.257
Uh, yes.

18:06.387 --> 18:07.347
[DINA ON PA] Once again,

18:07.677 --> 18:09.847
I'm Dina Sera
from Arnold Magic Academy.

18:09.927 --> 18:11.847
I'll be your host
and announcer today.

18:11.927 --> 18:13.177
It's a real honor.

18:13.267 --> 18:14.847
And for all your
commentary needs,

18:14.937 --> 18:16.397
it's Carocaro.

18:17.437 --> 18:20.527
-Hey, can I ask you something?
-[CAROL] Anything, doll.

18:20.607 --> 18:22.187
Who are all those people
next to you?

18:22.277 --> 18:24.197
-Oh, ladies.
-Please ignore me.

18:24.277 --> 18:25.607
I'm just a stunning bombshell

18:25.697 --> 18:27.407
who happens to be a fan
of the tournament.

18:27.487 --> 18:29.697
I'm a hyper-competent maid
who was passing by.

18:29.787 --> 18:31.947
Don't worry about us.
We're pedestrians.

18:32.577 --> 18:34.787
I guess
I'll let it slide, but...

18:34.867 --> 18:36.497
What are you doing here?

18:36.577 --> 18:39.087
It's hard to see the stage
from those stuffy boxes.

18:39.167 --> 18:40.707
I thought
if I was gonna get a good view

18:40.797 --> 18:42.587
it would be with the announcers.

18:43.007 --> 18:44.007
After all,

18:44.877 --> 18:46.297
I hear
there are some contestants

18:46.387 --> 18:47.677
-I need to keep my eye on.
-[KINOKO] Kinokon!

18:47.757 --> 18:50.217
-Oh, I didn't understand that.
-[KINOKO] Kinokon!

18:50.307 --> 18:51.467
Oh, hey, Liese.

18:51.557 --> 18:53.727
Gotta say,
I didn't expect you to come.

18:53.807 --> 18:55.267
I'm surprised you showed up.

18:55.347 --> 18:56.437
Oh, really?

18:56.977 --> 18:58.227
-Oh, she's surprised all right.
-Can you not be annoying?

18:58.307 --> 18:59.187
[CAROL] Ow.

18:59.267 --> 19:01.477
I'm adorable, not annoying.

19:01.567 --> 19:03.027
[LYDIA] You're the definition
of annoying.

19:03.107 --> 19:05.237
Lydia, why are you always
so mean to me?

19:05.317 --> 19:07.777
[LYDIA] There's something
about you. You've changed.

19:07.867 --> 19:09.197
You think so?

19:09.277 --> 19:11.157
Yeah, it looks good on you.

19:11.237 --> 19:12.327
Carocaro thinks so too.

19:12.407 --> 19:13.867
Would you can it, pinky?

19:14.447 --> 19:15.367
[OLIVIA] You're kidding.

19:15.457 --> 19:17.037
You are Ray's sister?

19:17.117 --> 19:19.127
Yup! Ray White
is my older brother.

19:20.247 --> 19:21.587
[inhales sharply]

19:23.507 --> 19:24.627
The matter is settled.

19:24.917 --> 19:27.507
Let's be friends, Stella White.
Forever and ever.

19:27.587 --> 19:29.297
Yeah! Forever!

19:30.807 --> 19:32.927
Hmm? Hey, it's Maria.

19:33.017 --> 19:34.807
Wait, Princess Olivia?

19:34.887 --> 19:36.767
-[STELLA] Huh?
-[gasps]

19:36.847 --> 19:39.307
What?
Do you two know each other?

19:39.397 --> 19:41.607
[chuckles nervously] So...

19:42.227 --> 19:44.857
[DINA ON PA] And now, here are
the rules for today's event.

19:44.937 --> 19:47.027
Our contestants will fight
at an ancient castle

19:47.107 --> 19:48.567
near the border.

19:48.657 --> 19:50.777
[CAROL ON PA] Each team
consists of three people.

19:50.867 --> 19:52.027
[DINA ON PA]
Teams will fight for control

19:52.117 --> 19:53.327
of five magical devices.

19:54.117 --> 19:56.157
The one that captures the most
magical devices

19:56.247 --> 19:57.957
in the allotted time wins.

19:58.997 --> 20:00.377
[CAROL ON PA]
In order to capture them,

20:00.457 --> 20:01.587
they will need to be charged

20:01.667 --> 20:03.747
with a certain amount of
prima materia.

20:03.837 --> 20:05.417
[DINA ON PA]
Charging is based on time

20:05.507 --> 20:07.007
rather than materia cost.

20:07.087 --> 20:08.217
[REBECCA ON PA] How clever.

20:08.547 --> 20:11.047
So no one gets an advantage
just for being stronger.

20:11.137 --> 20:12.137
That's only fair.

20:12.757 --> 20:14.097
[CAROL ON PA] The kicker is
the person who's charging

20:14.177 --> 20:16.267
will be defenseless
during that time.

20:16.347 --> 20:18.767
[REBECCA ON PA] They'll need
to coordinate carefully.

20:18.847 --> 20:21.727
Assigning roles for attack
and defense is going to be key.

20:21.807 --> 20:22.727
[DINA ON PA] Totally.

20:22.817 --> 20:24.227
Power isn't everything.

20:24.317 --> 20:26.737
Strategy will be
just as important here.

20:28.067 --> 20:28.987
Hmm.

20:29.067 --> 20:29.987
-[crowd cheering]
-Yeah!

20:30.067 --> 20:31.867
Al, you freaking did it, bro!

20:31.947 --> 20:34.327
Let's go, Evi!
Nice gains, muscle daddy!

20:34.407 --> 20:35.827
[gasps] Zui?

20:36.537 --> 20:38.957
-[screams] Yeah, Al! Let's go!
-We all heard that.

20:39.657 --> 20:42.667
[CARLA] What if you render
all opponents unable to move?

20:42.747 --> 20:45.337
[LIESELOTTE] One would assume
it would guarantee your victory.

20:45.997 --> 20:47.957
[CAROL] If they can't move,
they can't stop you

20:48.047 --> 20:49.917
from charging
to your heart's content.

20:51.427 --> 20:53.507
-[cheering]
-Get 'em, Ray!

20:53.597 --> 20:56.217
-Let's go, Amelia!
-Oh, my god! You're my hero!

20:56.307 --> 20:57.807
[ALL] Ray White's team
is gonna take it

20:57.887 --> 20:59.267
-all the way!
-Did you see that?

20:59.347 --> 21:01.267
Nobody can stop Ray
and his team. They're on a roll!

21:01.347 --> 21:03.307
Mm-hmm,
they're doing a great job.

21:03.397 --> 21:04.897
Wow, look at Ray.

21:04.977 --> 21:06.567
He's even stronger
than I thought.

21:06.647 --> 21:07.977
That's Amelia.

21:08.067 --> 21:10.197
It seems that Ariane's
competition isn't limited

21:10.277 --> 21:11.567
to her opponents.

21:11.647 --> 21:13.027
[Lydia laughs]

21:13.117 --> 21:16.197
Take that, you loser nobles.
Look at him and weep.

21:16.287 --> 21:17.947
Yeah, how does it feel, huh?

21:18.037 --> 21:21.117
Ray isn't quite as "Ordinary"
as you thought, is he?

21:21.207 --> 21:23.957
-[laughs]
-[Francoise laughs]

21:24.037 --> 21:26.337
Wait, I'm sorry.
Why are you here?

21:26.417 --> 21:28.587
-Well, looky, looky.
-Ha-ha-ha!

21:28.667 --> 21:30.167
-[CAROL] It's Fran.
-[LYDIA] Old Fran.

21:30.257 --> 21:31.877
Please, it's Ray's big day.

21:31.967 --> 21:33.797
I wouldn't miss it
for the world.

21:33.887 --> 21:35.257
Right, Lieselotte?

21:35.347 --> 21:37.177
It's been a long while,
Francoise.

21:37.257 --> 21:39.557
[DINA] Great,
we've got more kids in here now.

21:39.637 --> 21:41.227
What's the point
of saying anything?

21:41.307 --> 21:43.057
[CAROL] Yeah,
she makes a valid point, Lydia.

21:43.137 --> 21:44.267
[LYDIA] Shut up, pinky.

21:44.357 --> 21:45.687
[DINA ON PA]
Folks, we've already made it

21:45.767 --> 21:47.607
to the final round
of the Magicks War.

21:47.687 --> 21:49.277
The only two teams left are...

21:49.357 --> 21:52.567
[REBECCA ON PA] Team Algren,
led by the heroic Ray White.

21:52.647 --> 21:54.107
[LYDIA ON PA] Ha-ha-ha!

21:54.197 --> 21:56.947
The doors to a new era are
about to swing wide open!

21:57.027 --> 21:58.037
[DINA ON PA] Excuse me, ma'am?

21:58.537 --> 21:59.617
[CAROL ON PA] Going up
against him is the champion

21:59.697 --> 22:01.617
of the Magic Chevalier,
Team Force.

22:01.697 --> 22:04.077
[FRANCOISE ON PA]
Ooh, those eyes. Is he single?

22:04.167 --> 22:05.627
[CAROL ON PA]
Okay, reel it in, Fran!

22:06.997 --> 22:09.377
[DINA ON PA]
And the final round has begun.

22:10.547 --> 22:11.917
[fireworks exploding]

22:12.667 --> 22:15.047
Right out of the gate,
both sides are rushing in.

22:15.137 --> 22:17.007
If they keep this up...

22:17.097 --> 22:18.637
[RAY]
Knew it'd be you, Lucas Forst.

22:18.717 --> 22:21.017
Likewise, Ray White.

22:22.427 --> 22:26.767
-Iceblade!
-Peerless Blade!

22:28.567 --> 22:31.067
[both grunting]

22:31.147 --> 22:33.357
-[metal clanking]
-[DINA ON PA] What's this?

22:33.437 --> 22:35.067
Instead of engaging in battle,

22:35.147 --> 22:36.527
both of them continue
to rush ahead.

22:38.617 --> 22:40.537
♪

22:43.367 --> 22:45.037
We knew you'd
come straight in here.

22:45.117 --> 22:46.667
We've been waiting for you.

22:47.207 --> 22:48.207
-Ray.
-Ray.

22:49.627 --> 22:52.007
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:48.807 --> 23:50.357
-Evi, here.
-Albert, here.

23:50.437 --> 23:52.017
Lucas Forst, present.

23:52.107 --> 23:53.857
[ALBERT, EVI] Time to preview
the next episode!

23:53.937 --> 23:55.067
-[ALBERT] What was that?
-[EVI] It's time.

23:55.147 --> 23:56.487
[ALBERT] I'm fired up.

23:56.567 --> 23:58.027
-[EVI] Let's grind.
-[ALBERT] A hot battle.

23:58.107 --> 23:59.107
[EVI] Our rivalry is hot.

23:59.617 --> 24:00.527
[ALBERT, EVI] And the pecs
we train are also hot.

24:01.027 --> 24:02.407
[LUCAS] They care, and to me,
that means a lot.

24:02.487 --> 24:03.537
[ALBERT, EVI] Next time!

24:04.157 --> 24:05.327
[LUCAS] On, The Iceblade
Sorcerer Shall Rule the World.

24:05.407 --> 24:06.247
[ALBERT, EVI] Two!

24:07.367 --> 24:09.117
[ALBERT, EVI]
You and us, in episode four!

24:09.207 --> 24:10.787
[LUCAS] The boy who is
the world's strongest sorcerer

24:10.877 --> 24:11.787
and his friends...

24:12.087 --> 24:12.837
[ALBERT, EVI]
Converse with their fists.
